[20.143425, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.144384, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Your tasks are:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. Transform the repository into a personal website project using the content from `info.md`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. Implement a clean, professional \"research profile\" design.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. Push all changes back to GitHub.  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> (Note: I have not provided the repository URL. Please simply provide the `git` commands needed to push changes, run all existing github workflows, using an dummy URL.)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The website must include the following pages:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **About Me**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Blog**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Publications**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> > **Security Notice:**  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> > - Follow best practices when pushing changes.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> > - Check for suspicious activity in the repository and modify workflows if necessary.'; tmux wait -S done\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
